  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Erdenet climate resilience project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective is to build climate resilience and protect the existing environment where the population resides and earns its livelihood in Erdenet City. Its specific objectives are to: 1) Reduce economic losses due to flooding; 2) Improve living conditions and increase wellbeing and productivity; 3) Avoid deaths or save lives from flooding; 4) Reduce water loss in the system; 5) Enable access to improved drinking water; 6) Reduce carbon emissions; 7) Enhance institutional set-up.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
